choice.once:
{prefix}Before the negotiation starts, decide how you will handle it. Below are five sets of rules and the option of following none, in no particular order. Choose the one you expect to get you the most points in this negotiation. If you choose a set of rules, you must follow it for the whole negotiation.

{menu}

Reply with one JSON object and nothing else: {"choice": "<letter>", "reason": "<one sentence>"}

choice.again:
{prefix}Before you move, decide how you will handle the negotiation from here on. Below are five sets of rules and the option of following none, in no particular order. Choose the one you expect to get you the most points. You will be asked again before each of your moves and may choose differently then.

{menu}

Reply with one JSON object and nothing else: {"choice": "<letter>", "reason": "<one sentence>"}

